      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nice work!!\n\nOne small note: The commit message says that this change makes identical runs give identical ELK data. File deletion alone does not do this, because Elasticsearch keeps old events until somebody deletes the index. For the host tests, infra/ELK/host_metrics.py (change 1240426) already does this. It deletes the filebeat data stream before each case and waits until the doc count is stable.",
